up3.jpg"}, {"id": 1672744, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczup4.jpg"}, {"id": 1672745, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczup5.jpg"}, {"id": 1672746, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczup6.jpg"}, {"id": 1672747, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczup7.jpg"}, {"id": 1672741, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczup1.jpg"}], "slug": "kingdom-of-hope--1", "storyline": "Set in a fictional medieval land, the story begins as you emerge from nine years of oppression. Though victorious, the town bears the deep scars of battle. As one of the heroes who helped secure their freedom, you are entrusted with a gift from the new King \u2014 your very own farmstead.\n\nBeyond the farm, the townsfolk all carry the weight of their own challenges. From broken homes to lost kin \u2014 It is up to you to shape the bonds you form and help restore the lives of those around you. Hope has stirred at last, and the time has come to rebuild.", "summary": "Rise from nine years of tyranny to rebuild a scarred medieval land. As a celebrated hero, you\u2019re granted a farmstead by the new King. Forge a fresh life of growth, craft, and community.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kingdom-of-hope--1"}